WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.599
Thank you for being here.

00:00:01.599 --> 00:00:04.680
I'm thrilled to be here, merry Christmas.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.513
And you know what?

00:00:05.513 --> 00:00:08.370
Merry Christmas, as you know we're...

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.440
Well, we're celebrating Christmas now

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.630
because frankly we're
just not sure mankind

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.000
is gonna make it to December 25th.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.220
Yeah, let's do it now.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.540
We don't want to miss our last Christmas.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.800
And then we will know that
this is our last Christmas

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.140
to which we can make
that much more special.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.670
So nice of you to dress up in the spirit.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.020
Doesn't it... Aren't you
feeling Christmasy right now?

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.010
I am. I love Christmas and I still...

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.530
I don't think it's ever too
early to start the music.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:40.230
It is a little too early with
the decorations, I think.

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.590
I'd get stick of them by Christmas Eve,

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:43.800
but I just love it.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.130
I love it, love it, love it.

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:47.060
Yeah. Well, we did this again.

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.700
We're doing it now.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.780
Because we're not, we think
things are just gonna come

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.520
to an end in about four weeks.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.590
Oh God. Oh Lord.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.140
Good thing we can laugh about it, Conan.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.240
Can we though, can we?

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.350
I don't know maybe we can, we'll find out.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.800
I can laugh at anything
now I'm that medicated.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:06.690
You know there's... I have
a little bit of a bone

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.740
to pick with you Jane Lynch.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.020
Oh okay sure.

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.780
And you're universally beloved.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.150
People love you.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:16.500
And I'm such a huge fan of your work,

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.050
but I do have a complaint,

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:22.450
which is, you've been on my
show many, many, many times,

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.290
and every time you're on my show,

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.710
you come out, you sit down

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:30.140
and then you immediately
start talking to Andy.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.840
And you do that because you and Andy

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.070
have a prior relationship.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:39.730
You worked on a stage show
years ago before I knew Andy.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:41.490
You always sit down and
you start talking to Andy,

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:43.450
and then you keep talking to Andy.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:47.540
This is an actual... This
is the typical interview

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.260
that I do with you where...

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:52.330
Look at.. Not even making
eye contact with me.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.040
Not even looking at me,

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.470
only looking at Andy

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.530
and I find it very insulting.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:58.550
Well, I'm sorry about that,

00:01:58.550 --> 00:01:59.690
I wouldn't have thought that was true

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:01.610
until I saw that photographic evidence.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:04.500
But I'm sure we included you
in the conversations, I'm sure.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.310
I don't know. I think
you just easily left out.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.410
Is Andy there tonight?

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:12.120
Well, yeah, Andy's
sitting in the audience.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:13.520
Hey Andy, can you hear me?

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:15.383
Hi Jane?

00:02:15.383 --> 00:02:16.620
Hey, how you doing?

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.050
I'm doing fine.

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:18.960
How's your dog.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:21.442
You've had her for a year now, right?

00:02:21.442 --> 00:02:24.050
Daisy. Yeah, a little over a year.

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.800
A little dollop a Daisy.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.630
I love that dog. She's so cute.

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.220
I love that you keep
taking pictures of her

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:31.360
and posting it on Twitter, it's great.

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.940
Yeah. Well she's very photogenic.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.120
She's a very pretty dog

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.770
and she just keeps
getting bigger and bigger.

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:38.040
It's you know...

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.615
Would you say you're a dog person now?

00:02:39.615 --> 00:02:41.910
I didn't know why I was getting
a pony when I got a puppy.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:45.320
Yeah. Would you say that
you're a dog person now?

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:46.153
Oh, absolutely.

00:02:46.153 --> 00:02:47.511
I always was.

00:02:47.511 --> 00:02:49.609
I have--
Shh.

00:02:49.609 --> 00:02:51.960
He was talking about being
a dog person. Go ahead what?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.193
Yeah, no, yeah,

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.016
I do, I've always been a dog person.

00:02:56.016 --> 00:02:57.000
You have--
I mean everything.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.410
I love animals--
I do too.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.654
I would have cats if my kids
weren't allergic, you know?

00:03:01.654 --> 00:03:03.660
Mm-hmm, yeah.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:07.050
I usually have cats, but
they both passed away

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.040
in the last couple of years,

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.400
but I do have two dogs.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.430
We usually have three. Believe it or not.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.360
We have two Cocker Spaniels now.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.530
And one of them is kind of an asshole

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.010
and the other one is just
really old and blind and deaf.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.810
But we love them both equally.
Yeah.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:23.770
Andy, ask Conan if he's an animal person,

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.390
just so we can include him on this.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.540
Oh shit you're right.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.210
Hey Conan, you've got a dog, right?

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.760
Yes. I have two dogs.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:31.593
Tell us about them.

00:03:31.593 --> 00:03:33.653
Loki and Bosco. They're great dogs.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.720
But what kind of dogs are they Conan?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.960
They are Golden Retrievers.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.830
Okay. Hey, your dog is a mix?

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.570
Isn't she... Isn't Daisy a mix.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.461
Isn't she like a mutt--
Yeah, she's a mix.

00:03:44.461 --> 00:03:45.630
'Cause she's not a pure breed.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:48.410
I hating people get
pure breeds that just...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.110
My Cockers are men--
I'm sorry.

00:03:51.653 --> 00:03:52.720
I'm cutting it off.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:55.170
Jane, I think that you and I should talk

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.720
when there isn't someone interrupting us.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.050
Okay, I think that's probably
a good idea, whatever.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:00.620
I'll get with you after the show.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:01.460
Sounds great.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:02.550
It's great to hear your voice.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.950
I'm sorry I can't see your face.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:04.900
That's all right.

